I see my mother on the screen.
She is there, in Mexico.
I smile.
"Hi, Mum," I say.
My mother looks at me.
She has a big, warm smile.
"Hello, sweetheart," she says.
Her voice is also warm.
"How are you?" she asks.
"I am well, thank you," I say.
"And you?"
"I am well too," she answers.
It is so lovely to see my mother.
I am very, very happy.
